<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 14:58:00 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>盖茨基金会在学校人工智能方面投入了 4 亿美元。教师警告称，这可能“最终扩大”本应弥合的分歧</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/the-gates-foundation-ai-schools-teachers-warn-gap-reading-math/</link><description>一位教育工作者告诉《财富》杂志：“人工智能可以支持教师的专业知识，但无法取代它。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2284795836-e1786581624469.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 08:01:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/the-gates-foundation-ai-schools-teachers-warn-gap-reading-math/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普签署乌克兰战争制裁法案，威胁对俄罗斯石油或天然气前五名进口商征收高达 100% 的关税，但也有一些例外</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/trump-ukraine-war-sanctions-bill-tariff-top-importers-russian-oil-gas/</link><description>它的目的是让俄罗斯总统弗拉基米尔·普京(Vladimir Putin)失去在四年多前入侵邻国后继续在乌克兰进行战争所需的资源。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26261795514524-e1789826939717.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 14:16:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/trump-ukraine-war-sanctions-bill-tariff-top-importers-russian-oil-gas/</guid></item><item><title>“隐形财富”正在重塑豪华房地产：超级富豪如何购买价值数百万美元的豪宅</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/how-silicon-valley-elite-buy-multimillion-dollar-mansions-without-leaving-a-paper-trail-stealth-wealth/</link><description>现在，超级富豪将知名度视为一种负担，他们正在付出代价，让自己从豪华房地产记录中消失。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/GettyImages-1869963497-e1779464948701.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 13:08:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/how-silicon-valley-elite-buy-multimillion-dollar-mansions-without-leaving-a-paper-trail-stealth-wealth/</guid></item><item><title>人类亿万富翁联合创始人杰克·克拉克研究的是文学，而不是代码，他表示文科学位将在人工智能时代获胜</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/anthropic-jack-clark-liberal-arts-degree-ai-jobs-stem-computer-science-philosophy-critical-thinking-future-of-work/</link><description>Anthropic 受过文科教育的联合创始人表示，最好避免“死记硬背编程”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/GettyImages-2271201349.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 13:05:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/anthropic-jack-clark-liberal-arts-degree-ai-jobs-stem-computer-science-philosophy-critical-thinking-future-of-work/</guid></item><item><title>Lyft 首席执行官 David Risher 仍然是该公司的一名司机：这让他意识到，即使迟到一分钟，客户也可能丢掉饭碗</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/why-does-lyft-ceo-david-risher-still-drive-for-the-company/</link><description>作为一名司机，里舍尔度过了他的整个职业生涯：他的第一份工作是送《华盛顿邮报》。在加入 Lyft 之前，他曾在亚马逊的 Jeff Bezos 手下工作。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/GettyImages-2245804937-e1770655916207.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 13:02:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/why-does-lyft-ceo-david-risher-still-drive-for-the-company/</guid></item><item><title>顶级厨师决赛入围者 Brian Malarkey：在 27 家餐厅之后，我对我的家乡波特兰下了很大的赌注 - 今年我们的销售额将达到 1000 万美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/top-chef-brian-malarkey-opening-portland-restaurant-hometown/</link><description>人们告诉我波特兰是一个糟糕的赌注，而我选择了一个大赌注。我是一名厨师，不是经济学家，但我说到做到。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1211126523.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 12:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/top-chef-brian-malarkey-opening-portland-restaurant-hometown/</guid></item><item><title>我逃离了共产主义。 Z世代对此感兴趣吗？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/why-gen-z-is-drawn-to-communism-socialism/</link><description>对于许多美国年轻人来说，对共产主义和社会主义的兴趣更多地反映了对其他事物的挫败感，而不是对独裁统治的怀念。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Luba-Kassova-800-x-400_bd9208.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/why-gen-z-is-drawn-to-communism-socialism/</guid></item><item><title>从最好的朋友到公开战争：Better.com 的创始人与取代他的投资者</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/better-ceo-founder-fight-control-ouster/</link><description>一位前首席执行官和他的临时继任者之间的激烈争执已经升级为争夺曾经风光无限的 Better.com 控制权的斗争。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2270952506-e1789780687446.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 10:04:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/better-ceo-founder-fight-control-ouster/</guid></item><item><title>“一个大问题”：特朗普交易的股票比所有国会议员的总和还多。布什时代的道德律师解释了为什么你应该担心</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/trump-trades-congress-index-fund-ethics/</link><description>白宫表示，总统的 28,700 笔交易都是自动化且无需干预的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1250536011-e1789756525956.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/trump-trades-congress-index-fund-ethics/</guid></item><item><title>帕特·基辛格 (Pat Gelsinger) 和纳文·拉奥 (Naveen Rao)：我们看到了硅谷的快速发展和突破，但请考虑一下我们的发展方向</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/pat-gelsinger-naveen-rao-silicon-valley-move-fast-break-things/</link><description>我们从事人工智能工作，我们已经看到它减少了工作岗位。我们还看到它也创造了更多就业机会。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/GettyImages-1848352641-e1733419627252.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/pat-gelsinger-naveen-rao-silicon-valley-move-fast-break-things/</guid></item></channel></rss>